        "execSummary":  "Barclays\u0027 Claude deployment demonstrates that large financial institutions can achieve measurable operational scale with enterprise AI — 16,000 employees actively using an AI knowledge assistant and 120,000 daily emails processed autonomously. The 50% Claude Code developer adoption target by year-end signals that AI-augmented software development is now a strategic pillar, not a pilot. For enterprise leaders, this case validates an incremental deployment model: start with well-governed internal tools, demonstrate ROI, and expand systematically. Security and governance frameworks built in from the start were cited as key enablers of executive confidence and regulatory alignment.",
