        "execSummary":  "Anthropic\u0027s Cyber Mission marks a strategic pivot toward enterprise security infrastructure, embedding Claude directly into the operational workflows of major cybersecurity firms protecting national critical systems. For enterprise security leaders, this signals that frontier AI models are moving from productivity tools to active participants in threat detection and remediation pipelines. The OSS Scanner\u0027s 90%+ accuracy claim for vulnerability detection in open-source dependencies is significant for organizations managing software supply chain risk. CISOs and infrastructure leaders should monitor this program as a leading indicator of how AI vendors will compete on security capability as a differentiator.",
