        "summary":  "Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Payments enables AI agents to autonomously purchase services through a managed payment system, with BlockRun and Incarna implementing pay-per-inference transactions in three days using USDC stablecoin on the Base network via the x402 protocol. The system handles wallet management through Coinbase CDP, enforces spending limits at the infrastructure level rather than through prompt instructions, and supports micro-transactions ranging from $0.001 to $0.05 per call. Spending governance is enforced at the infrastructure layer, preventing overspending even if agent prompts are manipulated.",
        "execSummary":  "AgentCore Payments represents a new frontier in agentic AI: agents that can autonomously transact, enabling fully autonomous service procurement workflows without human-in-the-loop payment approvals. For enterprise finance and procurement leaders, the infrastructure-level spending controls — enforced independently of model prompts — address the core governance risk of autonomous financial transactions. The stablecoin settlement model (USDC/Base) will require treasury and compliance teams to assess crypto payment policy before deployment. Early adopters in industries with high-volume micro-service consumption (fintech, logistics, developer tools) stand to gain the most from this capability.",
